    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Development of iSDG model for the country
2.support to formalization of informal economy operators.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Contract with MI has permited the creation of iSDG model for Angola. The MI conducted assement of sector better aligment with SDG framework and a training for 20 government official was conducted to secure operationalization of the model for Angola. Further more on dialogue on Tax for SDG, UNDP has supported the country to be part of TIWB initiative.
2. More the 330 informal operator we were formalized and the platforma crescer digital is being implemented with INAPEM.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. establishment of the iSDG model in the country
2.Elaboration and submission of the SDG National Voluntering Report
3. Assessment of SDG mainstreaming in selected private sector in Angola</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.ToR and contracting of Milenium Institute to design the iSDG model
2. The SDG National Volunteer Review submitted
